<title>CANADA: Quebecois leader re-elected in home district.</title>
<headline>Quebecois leader re-elected in home district.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Separatist Bloc Quebecois leader Gilles Duceppe was re-elected Monday in his home riding of Laurier-Ste. Marie in downtown Montreal, Radio-Canada TV network reported.</p>
</text>
